The documents in this directory are United Nations parliamentary documentation
and are in the public domain.

The United Nations places two categories of its own work outside copyright:
parliamentary documentation, which is official records including resolutions,
and public information material published under a UN document symbol and not
offered for sale. Every document here carries a UN document symbol, such as
S/RES/2728(2024) or A/RES/66/165, and none is a sale item. Other United Nations
works, including its priced publications, are copyrighted and are not in this
dataset.

  https://shop.un.org/rights-permissions
  https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Commons:Copyright_rules_by_territory/United_Nations

The extracted text is a mechanical transcription of those documents and adds no
authorship. To the extent that assembling this dataset creates any right at
all, that right is waived. Use it for any purpose without permission or
attribution.

Attribution is nevertheless the courteous thing, and citing the United Nations
as the source is what makes the material traceable to the reader. The document
symbol in each record is enough to find the original at
https://docs.un.org/{language}/{symbol}.

The scripts that produced this directory are covered by the LICENSE at the root
of this repository, which is a separate matter from the documents themselves.
